       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""iso-26262-asil-levels""><a class=""header"" hre"
       & "f=""#iso-26262-asil-levels"">ISO 26262 ASIL Levels</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>ISO 26262 defines four Automotive Safety Integrity Levels (ASIL A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "D) plus the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "quality-managed (QM) classification for road-vehicle functional safety."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex assesses compliance against all of them by re-labelling the same fo"
       & "ur"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "evidence checks it computes for DO-178C: HLR traceability, no orphan tags,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "passing tests, and a minimum SPARK proof level.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""level-definitions""><a class=""header"" href=""#level-definitions"">Level"
       & " Definitions</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Severity</th><th>Failure Condition</th><th>Example</th>"
       & "</tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>Catastrophic</td><td>Uncontrolled, life-threatening malfun"
       & "ction</td><td>Steering/brake-by-wire, airbag deployment control</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>Hazardous</td><td>Severe injury, survival uncertain</td><t"
       & "d>Stability control, adaptive cruise control</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>B</td><td>Major</td><td>Non-fatal injury possible</td><td>Lane-keepi"
       & "ng assist, headlamp control</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A</td><td>Minor</td><td>No injury; limited function loss</td><td>Win"
       & "dow/sunroof control, seat adjustment</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>No effect</td><td>No safety effect (quality-managed)</td>"
       & "<td>Infotainment, navigation</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""assessment-criteria""><a class=""header"" href=""#assessment-criteria"">A"
       & "ssessment Criteria</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex evaluates the same four criteria for every level; only the level"
       & " name"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the minimum proof bar change.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""1-hlr-traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#1-hlr-traceability"">1. "
       & "HLR Traceability</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "D</td><td>All high-level requirements (HLRs) traced to source-code tags (<co"
       & "de>-- HLR-XXXX</code>)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>Recommended but not enforced</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""2-orphan-tags""><a class=""header"" href=""#2-orphan-tags"">2. Orphan Tag"
       & "s</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "D</td><td>Every in-source HLR tag must correspond to a defined HLR in HLR.md"
       & "</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>Recommended but not enforced</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""3-test-passfail""><a class=""header"" href=""#3-test-passfail"">3. Test P"
       & "ass/Fail</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "D</td><td>100% tests passing</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "B</td><td>100% tests passing</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>No requirement</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""4-minimum-spark-level""><a class=""header"" href=""#4-minimum-spark-leve"
       & "l"">4. Minimum SPARK Level</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Minimum SPARK Level</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>Gold</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>Silver</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>B</td><td>Bronze</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A</td><td>Stone</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>None (Stone)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""mapping-to-the-shared-rigor-tier""><a class=""header"" href=""#mapping-t"
       & "o-the-shared-rigor-tier"">Mapping to the shared rigor tier</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>ISO 26262 ASIL levels map onto the same A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "E rigor tier DO-178C uses, so one"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment satisfies both standards at once:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>ASIL</th><th>Shared tier</th><th>DO-178C equivalent</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>A</td><td>DAL-A</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>B</td><td>DAL-B</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>DAL-C</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A</td><td>D</td><td>DAL-D</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>QM</td><td>E</td><td>DAL-E</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""cli-selection""><a class=""header"" href=""#cli-selection"">CLI selection"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">adacovex --target=. --asil=B          # ass"
       & "ess at ASIL B"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=. --asil=D          # assess at ASIL D (requires Gold SPAR"
       & "K)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=. --standard=iso26262 --dal=C   # ASIL B via the shared ti"
       & "er"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=. --standard=all    # badges for DO-178C + ISO 26262 + IEC"
       & " 62304"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See <a href=""../standards.html"">Standards</a> for the full cross-standard"
       & " tier mapping,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""adacovex-dal-levels.html"">DAL Levels</a> for the DO-178C criteria t"
       & "his page"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "generalizes, and <a href=""adacovex-spark-levels.html"">SPARK Levels</a> for t"
       & "he per-level"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof bar.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""assessment-output""><a class=""header"" href=""#assessment-output"">Asses"
       & "sment Output</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tool reports each criterion as met/unmet and a final Achieved/Unmet s"
       & "tatus,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "labelled with the ASIL name:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>Target level: ASIL B"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Status: Achieved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR traced:  24 /  24"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Orphan tags: No"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Tests passing: Yes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Min SPARK level met: Yes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
