       & "                <div id=""mdbook-content"" class=""content"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""do-178c-dal-levels""><a class=""header"" href="""
       & "#do-178c-dal-levels"">DO-178C DAL Levels</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>DO-178C defines five Development Assurance Levels (DAL A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "E) corresponding"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to the severity of failure conditions. adacovex assesses compliance against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "all five levels.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""level-definitions""><a class=""header"" href=""#level-definitions"">Level"
       & " Definitions</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>DAL</th><th>Severity</th><th>Failure Condition</th><th>Example</th><"
       & "/tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A</td><td>Catastrophic</td><td>Prevents continued safe flight/landin"
       & "g</td><td>Flight controls, engine FADEC</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>B</td><td>Hazardous</td><td>Large reduction in safety margins</td><t"
       & "d>Autopilot, navigation</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>Major</td><td>Significant increase in crew workload</td><t"
       & "d>Flight management system</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>Minor</td><td>Slight increase in crew workload</td><td>Cab"
       & "in pressure display</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>E</td><td>No effect</td><td>No impact on safety</td><td>In-flight en"
       & "tertainment</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""assessment-criteria""><a class=""header"" href=""#assessment-criteria"">A"
       & "ssessment Criteria</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>adacovex evaluates four criteria for each DAL level:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""1-hlr-traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#1-hlr-traceability"">1. "
       & "HLR Traceability</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>DAL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "C</td><td>All high-level requirements (HLRs) traced to source code tags (<co"
       & "de>-- HLR-XXXX</code>)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "E</td><td>Recommended but not enforced</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""2-orphan-tags""><a class=""header"" href=""#2-orphan-tags"">2. Orphan Tag"
       & "s</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>DAL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "C</td><td>Every in-source HLR tag must correspond to a defined HLR in HLR.md"
       & "</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "E</td><td>Recommended but not enforced</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""3-test-passfail""><a class=""header"" href=""#3-test-passfail"">3. Test P"
       & "ass/Fail</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>DAL</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "B</td><td>100% tests passing with MC/DC coverage (structural coverage analys"
       & "is)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>100% tests passing (statement coverage)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>100% tests passing</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>E</td><td>No requirement</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""4-minimum-spark-level""><a class=""header"" href=""#4-minimum-spark-leve"
       & "l"">4. Minimum SPARK Level</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>DAL</th><th>Minimum SPARK Level</th><th>Requirement</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>A</td><td>Gold</td><td>Core invariants proved, AoRTE achieved</td></"
       & "tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>B</td><td>Silver</td><td>Partial proofs, all VCs attempted</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>C</td><td>Bronze</td><td>Flow analysis passes</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>D</td><td>Stone</td><td>Valid SPARK subset</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td>E</td><td>None</td><td>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The minimum levels match <code>Min_SPARK_For</code> in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>src/compliance/adacovex-compliance-dal.adb</code>. Gold is the minimum"
       & " compliance"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "baseline; Platinum (every functional contract proved) is a best-effort ideal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reported when achieved, not a compliance gate. Justified VCs (GNATprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>pragma Annotate</code>) count neither as proved nor unproved and never"
       & " downgrade"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the level.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""dal-c-default""><a class=""header"" href=""#dal-c-default"">DAL-C (defaul"
       & "t)</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The default assessment level is DAL-C. To assess at a different level:</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">adacovex --target=../Ada_CRDT --dal=A"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=../Ada_CRDT --dal=B"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=../Ada_CRDT --dal=D"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adacovex --target=../Ada_CRDT --dal=E"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""assessment-output""><a class=""header"" href=""#assessment-output"">Asses"
       & "sment Output</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tool reports each criterion as met/unmet and provides a final"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Achieved/Unmet status:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>Target DAL: C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Status: Achieved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR traced:  24 /  24"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Orphan tags: No"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Tests passing: Yes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Min SPARK level met: Yes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""see-also""><a class=""header"" href=""#see-also"">See also</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""../standards.html"">Standards</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the cross-standard rigor-tier mapping"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(DO-178C / ISO 26262 / IEC 62304)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""adacovex-asil-levels.html"">ASIL Levels</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the ISO 26262 levels this page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "criteria are re-labelled for</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""adacovex-class-levels.html"">Safety Classes</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the IEC 62304 classes this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s criteria are re-labelled for</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><a href=""adacovex-spark-levels.html"">SPARK Levels</a> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the proof bar per DAL"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Gold / Silver / Bronze / Stone)</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
