       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a record component"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "@formal Name  Description.      "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " Document a generic formal</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Standard tag aliases are accepted (<code>@parameter</code> == <code>@para"
       & "m</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>@returns</code> == <code>@return</code>), and the summary tags <code>@"
       & "brief</code> / <code>@summary</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "mark a subprogram as documented.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Conventions (following Ada_CRDT style):"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Prefix:  "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "   (two dashes + two spaces)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Summary: Capitalized sentence ending with a period."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Alignment: Two spaces between tag name and description text."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Placement: Summary lines first, then tag lines, then declaration.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Other standard comment styles are also recognised as docstrings:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (single space, <code>-- </code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (two spaces, <code>--  </code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "  one-line summary (tab separator)"
