       & "A bare <code>--</code> or <code>---</code> divider is not a docstring.  Docs"
       & "trings can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "appear before or after the declaration.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Google style (Doxygen-free Python convention):"
