       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovexprove""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovexprove"">Adacovex.Prove</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>GNATprove runner for the <code>adacovex prove</code> subcommand."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It resolves a gnatprove executable.  It runs it against a target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s root .gpr file.  It leaves a fresh obj/gnatprove/gnatprove.out"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for the standard assessment pipeline to parse.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Resolution priority (lightweight: adacovex only requires <code>alr</code>"
       & " on PATH):</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. If the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s alire.toml or alire-dev.toml declares gnatprove as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a dependency, deploy only the gnatprove binary crate.  This crate is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a self-contained bundle with no dependencies.  Deploy it into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "~/.adacovex/toolchain via <code>alr -n get gnatprove=&lt;version&gt;</code>,"
       & " then run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "it directly.  This avoids the fragile <code>alr exec</code> path.  That path"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "used to compose the target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entire dev-manifest dependency set"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(covex, gnatdoc_bin, gnatformat_bin, and more).  Flaky third-party"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "downloads in CI cannot fail a proof run.  No dev-manifest swap is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ever needed.  The manifest can declare the version as a rich set"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "expression (<code>^15.1.0</code>, <code>~15.1.0</code>, and more).  The lead"
       & "ing operator is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "stripped to yield the bare version that alr accepts.  A"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest-declared prover is authoritative.  When it cannot be"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "deployed, the run fails instead of falling back.  A different"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gnatprove version can change which VCs are discharged.  Results must"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "always come from the pinned prover.  Priorities 2 to 5 apply only to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "projects whose manifest does not declare gnatprove.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A gnatprove version pinned globally.  The pin comes from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ADACOVEX_GNATPROVE_VERSION environment variable or the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>[prove] gnatprove-version = ""16.1.0""</code> key in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "~/.adacovex/adacovex.toml.  Run_Prove reads it and passes it in as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Pinned_Version.  The exact version is deployed via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alr -n get gnatprove=&lt;version&gt;</code> and run directly.  Like th"
       & "e manifest"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pin, it is authoritative.  A failure to deploy is a failure to run."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is folded into the proof result-cache identity.  A different pinned"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "version can never reuse a stale proof.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A gnatprove already on $PATH.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. A cached gnatprove in ~/.adacovex/toolchain/bin (download layout) or a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "previously <code>alr get</code>-deployed gnatprove_*/ crate under the same d"
       & "ir.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>#. Last resort: a platform toolchain download.  It uses curl.  It is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "used only when no deployable, on-PATH, or cached gnatprove is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "available.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>So the order is: manifest pin &gt; global pin (config/env) &gt; PATH &gt;"
       & " cache &gt;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "download."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-PROVE: GNATprove subcommand</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=""../architecture.html#gnatprove-toolch"
       & "ain-resolution-prove-subcommand"">Architecture "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " toolchain resolution</a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Note:</strong> All items in this package are public.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""types""><a class=""header"" href=""#types"">Types</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""type-prove_options""><a class=""header"" href=""#type-prove_options"">typ"
       & "e Prove_Options</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-ada"">type Prove_Options is record"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Jobs        : Integer := -1;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Level       : Integer := -1;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Timeout     : Integer := -1;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Steps       : Integer := -1;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Memlimit    : Integer := -1;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Force       : Boolean := False;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "No_Inlining : Boolean := False;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Suppress_Warnings : Boolean := True;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Suppress_Sets : Ada.Strings.Unbounded.Unbounded_String :="
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Ada.Strings.Unbounded.Null_Unbounded_String;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Cache : Boolean := True;"
