       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version-control-system abstraction for differential modes."
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "compare-base and "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "coverage-delta need a snapshot of a base revision"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "without disturbing the working tree.  Legacy codebases can live in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Mercurial, Subversion, Fossil, or jj rather than git.  The snapshot"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "operations are dispatched per VCS here:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>git    - <code>git worktree add --detach</code> in a linked worktree"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "hg     - <code>hg archive -r REF DIR</code> (pure export, no working-copy ch"
       & "ange)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "svn    - <code>svn info --show-item url</code> + <code>svn export -r REF URL"
       & " DIR</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fossil - copy the repo DB and <code>fossil open</code> it at REF in a scratc"
       & "h dir"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "jj     - <code>jj git export</code> into the internal git store, then a git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "worktree add against .jj/repo/store/git (jj commits ARE git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "commits, and any change or commit id resolves)</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Detection is marker-file based (.git / .jj / .hg / .svn / .fslckout /</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
