       & ASCII.LF
       & "Runs only on Linux/WSL (uses sh -c for CWD-dependent tools such as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "fossil)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR-DIFF: VCS abstraction for differential assessment</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=""../vcs.html"">VCS support</a></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<blockquote>"
       & ASCII.LF
