       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is standard-aware (defaults to all standards like <code>sbom</code>) with"
       & " light/dark"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "theme support (toggle button, respects <code>prefers-color-scheme</code>). T"
       & "he static"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "page shell (CSS, header, theme script) is a real HTML file,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>resources/dashboard.html</code>, bundled into the binary at build time"
       & "."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> assembles the authored CSS (<code>resour"
