       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript (<code>resources/js/</code>), which is also how the SBOM asset sc"
       & "anner"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tells vendored components from the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own modules.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The tool regenerates <code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> (a "
       & "String"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "constant, committed and byte-identical when unchanged).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ada compiler includes that constant in the final binary. Every releas"
       & "ed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary - whether a GitHub release artifact or an Alire crate binary - carrie"
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the complete dashboard with no external file dependencies.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>At runtime, <code>Adacovex.Renderers.HTML.Render_Dashboard_Internal</code"
       & "> only builds"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the dynamic card markup and injects it at the <code>__CARDS__</code> placeho"
