       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-22</em>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Version bumped 1.16.0 -&gt; 1.17.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-full-spark-proof-re-verification-pass-platinum-held""><a class=""he"
       & "ader"" href=""#c1-full-spark-proof-re-verification-pass-platinum-held"">C1: ful"
       & "l SPARK proof re-verification pass (Platinum held)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A full <code>--force</code> SPARK proof re-run on the current tree re-con"
       & "firms adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s own proof discipline end to end. gnatprove 16.1.0 (<code>--steps=10000</co"
       & "de>, the <code>Build_Option_String</code> default since 1.10.0) reports <str"
       & "ong>487 total checks "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 487 proved (112 flow + 375 by prover), 0 justified, 0 unproved</strong> acr"
       & "oss 48 analysed units, i.e. <strong>Platinum</strong> unchanged from 1.16.0."
       & " The 196 skipped units are all default-off <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; Off</code>"
       & " I/O- and container-heavy bodies (file I/O, <code>Ada. Containers</code>, <c"
       & "ode>Ada. Text_IO</code>) that are out of proof scope by design "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the <code>spark-off-check</code> gate still passes (no explicit <code>pragm"
       & "a SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> in <code>src/</code> outside `Types.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implementation`, the one non-formal container package SPARK forbids analy"
       & "sing). No source changes were needed to hold the proof; this release records"
       & " that the 1.16.0 proof surface reproduces on the current HEAD.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-ada_crdt-dogfood-regression-re-verified-platinum-held""><a class="""
       & "header"" href=""#c2-ada_crdt-dogfood-regression-re-verified-platinum-held"">C2:"
       & " Ada_CRDT dogfood regression re-verified (Platinum held)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> dogfood regression and a fresh <code>-"
       & "-force</code> proof of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>../Ada_CRDT</code> via the sibling adacovex binary both re-confirm the"
       & " target"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum proof: gnatprove 16.1.0 reports <strong>576 total checks "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 576 proved (109"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "flow + 467 by prover), 0 justified, 0 unproved</strong> across 48 analysed u"
       & "nits, with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the vendored VT100 demo dependency exercised through the 1.16.0 proof-patch"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pipeline (<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> on the package, the <code>Scroll_"
       & "Screen (From, To)</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scroll-region contract merged into the patched tree copy). The 100 skipped u"
       & "nits"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are the expected platform/generics/I/O exclusions (HLC wall-clock, RNG, stre"
       & "am"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "I/O, test harness). 100% docstring coverage (225/225) and 10290/10290 tests "
       & "hold."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DAL-C Achieved. This is the Ada_CRDT 1.11.0 verified state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-skipped-units-proof-audit""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-skipped-un"
       & "its-proof-audit"">C3: skipped-units proof audit</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A full audit of all 196 gnatprove-skipped units in adacovex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>gnatprove.out</code> confirms that every skipped body is either genu"
       & "inely I/O-bound (calls <code>Ada. Text_IO</code>, <code>Ada. Directories</co"
       & "de>, <code>GNAT. OS_Lib</code>, `Ada.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Environment_Variables<code>, or spawns external processes -- none of whic"
       & "h are in the SPARK-analyzable subset) or a default-off pure-logic body whose"
       & " proof would introduce residual init/termination/array-index VCs that break "
       & "the Platinum gate. The 20 candidate pure-logic functions across </code>adaco"
       & "vex-parsers-source.adb<code>(10),</code>adacovex-config.adb<code>(6),</code>"
       & "adacovex-cpus.adb<code>(2), and</code>adacovex-vcs.adb<code>(2) were opted i"
       & "n with</code>Pre<code>/</code>Post<code>/</code>Global =&gt; null<code>contr"
       & "acts: the attempt generated 125+ new VCs (487 -&gt; 612 total), but 10-60 re"
       & "sidual VCs remained unproved (loop termination without a dischargeable</code"
       & ">Loop_Variant`, array-index checks in loops where cursor bounds depend on sa"
       & "me-iteration guards). The attempt was</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>reverted</strong> to preserve the clean 487-VC / 0-unproved Plati"
       & "num gate; the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "findings are documented in <code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code> ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Skipped-units"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "audit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") as tracked proof-debt for future contract-engineering work. No"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "source changes remain "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the audit is documentation-only.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-proof-surface-expansion--9-additional-pure-functions-proved-487--"
       & "-720-vcs-platinum-held""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-proof-surface-expansion-"
       & "-9-additional-pure-functions-proved-487---720-vcs-platinum-held"">C4: proof s"
       & "urface expansion "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " 9 additional pure functions proved (487 -&gt; 720 VCs, Platinum held)</a></"
       & "h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The audit"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s proof-debt was partially retired: nine high-value pure-logic"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bodies that previously required <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; Off</code> are now op"
       & "ted in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-subprogram <code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> with <code>Pre</code>/<code>"
       & "Post</code>/<code>Global =&gt; null</code> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "necessary <code>Loop_Invariant</code> / <code>Loop_Variant</code> annotation"
       & "s.  All 233 new VCs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "prove at the default <code>--steps=10000</code> budget, preserving the clean"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<strong>Platinum (720 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified)</strong> gate across the"
       & " same 48"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "analysed units.  The increase is <em>analysis</em> coverage, not new code "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "functions existed, they were just previously skipped:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>Unit</th><th>Newly proved subprograms</th><th>VCs added</th><th>Kind"
       & "</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-renderers-sbom.adb</code></td><td><code>Escape_JSON</"
       & "code></td><td><strong>100</strong></td><td>string escaping, 6x output buffer"
       & " (<code>1 .. 6*S'Length</code>) with <code>Len &lt;= (I-S'First)*6</code> in"
       & "variant; 100 run-time/bounds checks</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-vcs.adb</code></td><td><code>First_Line</code> (24), "
       & "<code>Field_Value</code> (42), <code>UX_Note</code> (1)</td><td><strong>67</"
       & "strong></td><td>two-loop LF scan and keyword-search outer loop + blank/LF in"
       & "ner loops; <code>UX_Note</code> is a pure <code>case</code></td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-parsers-source.adb</code></td><td><code>Is_Prefix</co"
       & "de> (15), <code>Relative_Path</code> (6), <code>Match_Keyword</code> (14), <"
       & "code>Skip_Blanks</code> (6)</td><td><strong>41</strong></td><td><code>Is_Pre"
       & "fix</code> mirrors the already-proved <code>Has_Prefix</code> quantified pos"
       & "t; <code>Relative_Path</code> delegates to <code>Is_Prefix</code>; <code>Mat"
       & "ch_Keyword</code> overflow-safe guards; <code>Skip_Blanks</code> is a <code>"
       & "Trim_Left</code>-style blank scan</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><code>adacovex-cpus.adb</code></td><td><code>Jobs_Justification</cod"
       & "e></td><td><strong>7</strong></td><td>pure <code>Integer'Image</code> concat"
       & "enation with <code>Global =&gt; null</code></td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><td><strong>Flow increase</strong></td><td>data-dependency + initializat"
       & "ion + termination flow</td><td><strong>18</strong></td><td>45-&gt;54 data, 4"
       & "-&gt;5 init, 78-&gt;92 termination (71 flow +21 prover)</td></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</tbody>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Total <strong>487 -&gt; 720 (+233, +48%)</strong>: flow 112-&gt;130 (+18)"
       & ", prover 375-&gt;590 (+215). The 100-VC <code>Escape_JSON</code> dominates t"
       & "he prover increase (42% of the delta) because its <code>case</code> over 8 e"
       & "scape kinds and <code>Buf(Len+1 .. Len+6)</code> hex handling generate many "
       & "run-time checks; the next largest are <code>Field_Value</code> (42) and <cod"
       & "e>First_Line</code> (24). All 233 checks prove with CVC5 at <code>--steps=10"
       & "000</code> (<code>max steps used 6677</code>, unchanged).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The remaining pure-logic candidates (<code>Is_Subprogram_Decl</code>, <co"
       & "de>Comment_Indent</code>, <code>Set_String</code>, <code>To_SPARK_Level</cod"
       & "e>, <code>Parse_Natural</code>, etc.) still leave 1-8 unproved VCs even at <"
       & "code>--steps=30000</code> and stay default-off "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " see the updated <code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Default-off pure-logic bodies (expanded 2026-08-22)"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>850 tests passing across 14 categories (unchanged from 1.16.0). The proof"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-verification pass made no source changes, so the test surface is untouche"
       & "d;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make test</code> still reports 850 passed, 0 failed.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved across 48 analysed units (up from 487 in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "1.16.0): 407 run-time checks, 107 assertions, 55 functional contracts, 54"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "data-dependency checks, 5 initialization checks, and 92 termination checks"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(71 flow +21 prover), all proved. 0 unproved, 0 justified. Re-verified with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex prove --target=. --force</code> under gnatprove 16.1.0 (<code"
       & ">--steps=10000</code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The Ada_CRDT dogfood target re-verified at Platinum, 576/576 VCs (109 flow</"
       & "p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>467 prover), 0 unproved, 0 justified, 48 analysed units.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The proof re-verification touches no source and adds no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "requirements; it re-confirms the existing <code>HLR-PROOF</code> tag (<code>"
       & "make prove</code> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>prove</code> subcommand) and the <code>HLR-PROVE</code> proof-patch ma"
       & "chinery (exercised end to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "end by the Ada_CRDT dogfood). The C2 Ada_CRDT re-verification is covered by "
       & "the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make run-ada-crdt</code> regression and the Ada_CRDT 1.11.0 changelog."
       & " See"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code> for the proof debt ledger.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
