       & " <code>--quiet</code> and <code>--suppress-warnings=SETS</code></a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>prove</code> subcommand"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s stdout is now <strong>quiet by default for local runs</strong>:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNATprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s benign informational messages (the default suppression set "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & ASCII.LF
