       & "<h3 id=""c1-dashboard-tabs-with-dependency-tree-and-chartscss-fixes""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#c1-dashboard-tabs-with-dependency-tree-and-chartscss-fixes"""
       & ">C1: Dashboard tabs with dependency tree and Charts.css fixes</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>--serve</code> dashboard is now organised into clickable tabs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(Overview / Proof / Tests / Compliance / Dependencies / Charts) instead of a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "single card stack.  The new <strong>Dependencies</strong> tab renders the re"
       & "solved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alire.toml</code> / <code>alire.lock</code> graph as a collapsible <co"
       & "de>&lt;details&gt;</code> tree with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "scope badges (<code>base</code> / <code>dev</code> / <code>transitive</code>"
       & " / <code>vendored</code>), child counts, and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "client-side name filter.  The same graph is already served at <code>GET /api"
       & "/deps</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and via <code>--emit-metrics</code>, so the tab is a view, not a new data so"
       & "urce.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Charts.css rendering is fixed: bar sizes are now emitted as <code>0..1</c"
       & "ode> fractions (not <code>0..100</code>) so <code>charts.css</code> scales c"
       & "orrectly, and the SPARK donut now shows proved vs <em>unproved</em> slices ("
       & "previously proved vs total duplicated the proved arc and hid regressions). T"
       & "est-category bars are normalised to the largest category (previously every b"
       & "ar was <code>100%</code>). The template (<code>resources/dashboard.html</cod"
       & "e>) is now a centered <code>max-width:1180px</code> layout with a sticky tab"
       & " bar, <code>localStorage</code>-persisted active tab, and hash-routing (<cod"
       & "e>#deps</code>, <code>#proof</code>, etc. compose with <code>? theme=</code>"
       & ").</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Ada side (<code>Renderers. HTML</code>) is split into <code>Render_Da"
       & "shboard_Internal</code> with per-tab builders, a new <code>Render_Deps_HTML<"
       & "/code> tree builder, and a <code>Render_Charts</code> overload that takes th"
       & "e graph for future scope pies. The bundled template is regenerated via <code"
       & ">tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> as before. See <code>docs/dashboard.md</code>"
       & " (tabs, Dependencies, Charts) and <code>docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code>.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-make-targets-grouped-and-a-sync-alias""><a class=""header"" href=""#c"
       & "2-make-targets-grouped-and-a-sync-alias"">C2: Make targets grouped and a <cod"
       & "e>sync</code> alias</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make help</code> now groups targets (<code>Core</code>, <code>Asses"
       & "sment</code>, <code>Docs &amp; sync</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Gates</code>, <code>Release</code>) instead of a flat list.  A new <co"
       & "de>make sync</code> alias runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the four doc-sync targets that previously had to be invoked individually:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>agents-tree</code> + <code>proof-status</code> + <code>test-count</cod"
       & "e> + <code>doc-links</code> + <code>description</code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The grouping mirrors the pipeline order (<code>check</code> is still the ful"
       & "l gate, now"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "explicitly listed as <code>Core</code>).  No target semantics changed; <code"
       & ">make check</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "still runs the same cheap-first gates, build+test+prove+doc+sbom, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "count-sync checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-ci-less-brittle-with-timeouts-and-clearer-debugging-output""><a cl"
       & "ass=""header"" href=""#c3-ci-less-brittle-with-timeouts-and-clearer-debugging-o"
       & "utput"">C3: CI less brittle with timeouts and clearer debugging output</a></h"
       & "3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>ci.yml</code> now sets <code>concurrency.cancel-in-progress</code> "
       & "and <code>timeout-minutes</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(25 for self-assessment, 15 for tests/consumer, 10 for coverage-gate),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adds <code>fetch-tags: true</code> to the coverage-gate checkout (previously"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>fetch-depth: 0</code> alone could miss tags on shallow clones), and ke"
       & "eps the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "existing <code>actions/cache</code> for both the toolchain and the result ca"
       & "che.  The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docs (<code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>) add a <strong>Debugging guide</strong> tab"
       & "le that maps every"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>CI GATE:</code> / <code>WARNING</code> / <code>Skipped_Ct</code> / <co"
       & "de>result cache:</code> line to its meaning"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the action to take, and spells out the three artifacts that are always"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "available without re-running: <code>::error</code>/<code>::notice</code> ann"
       & "otations, the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>## adacovex assessment</code> summary, and the <code>adacovex-assessme"
       & "nt</code> artifact"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(full log + <code>adacovex-metrics.json</code> when <code>emit-metrics</code"
       & "> is set).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-completion-exposed-as-adacovex-completion-command""><a class=""head"
       & "er"" href=""#c4-completion-exposed-as-adacovex-completion-command"">C4: Complet"
       & "ion exposed as <code>adacovex completion</code> command</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>adacovex completion [SHELL]</code> (also <code>adacovex --completio"
       & "n[=SHELL]</code>) is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "now documented as the primary entry point in <code>docs/cli-reference.md</co"
       & "de> and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "man page, with the flag form noted as an alias.  The shell (<code>bash</code"
       & "> / <code>fish</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>zsh</code> / <code>pwsh</code>) is auto-detected from <code>$SHELL</co"
       & "de> when omitted.  No flag"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "semantics changed; the parity gate still treats <code>completion</code> as C"
       & "LI-only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(like <code>status</code> / <code>man</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>886 tests passing (unchanged) across 14 categories.  The HTML/Markdown"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "renderer category still pins the 38 dashboard and docs expectations (theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dropdown, badge images, <code>__THEME__</code> substitution, and the new tab"
       & " markers).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved across 48 analysed units (unchanged from"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "1.19.0): dashboard tabbing, dep-tree rendering, chart fixes, make help"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "grouping, and CI/doc updates live in default-off or I/O-bound bodies "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "new proof obligations.  0 unproved, 0 justified.  Re-verified with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex prove --target=. --force</code> under gnatprove 16.1.0 (<code"
       & ">--steps=10000</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs.  Coverage for the changed surface:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-DASH</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " tabs, dep tree, chart fixes (renderer tests, dashboard docs);</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-CLI</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>completion</code> command docs and help text (config tests);</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-CI</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " <code>ci.yml</code> timeouts/concurrency and docs/ci-cd.md debugging guide."
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See <code>docs/cli-reference.md</code>, <code>docs/dashboard.md</code>, <"
       & "code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
