       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1240""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1240"">adacovex 1.24.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.23.0 -&gt; 1.24.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-complexity-module-docstrings-and-spark-mode-alignment""><a class="""
       & "header"" href=""#c1-complexity-module-docstrings-and-spark-mode-alignment"">C1:"
       & " Complexity module docstrings and SPARK mode alignment</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>Adacovex. Complexity</code> package now carries a package-level"
       & " docstring and <code>@brief</code> tags on every public subprogram, and all "
       & "body subprograms have docstrings. The package-level <code>pragma SPARK_Mode "
       & "(Off)</code> remains necessary because it instantiates the non-formal `Ada. "
       & "Containers.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Vectors`; the exception is now documented consistently across AGENTS.md, "
       & "the Makefile, and the proof-status ledger.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-complexity-gate-ci-provisions-alire-before-build""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#c2-complexity-gate-ci-provisions-alire-before-build"">C2: Complexit"
       & "y gate CI provisions Alire before build</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>complexity-gate</code> jobs in <code>ci.yml</code> and <code>pr"
       & "-check.yml</code> now run"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alire-project/setup-alire</code> before <code>make complexity-check</c"
       & "ode>, so the gate no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "longer fails with <code>/bin/sh: alr: not found</code> on a fresh runner.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-temp-directory-and-shell-abstraction-for-non-linux-platforms""><a "
       & "class=""header"" href=""#c3-temp-directory-and-shell-abstraction-for-non-linux-"
       & "platforms"">C3: Temp directory and shell abstraction for non-Linux platforms<"
       & "/a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Hardcoded <code>/tmp/</code> paths in <code>adacovex-cpus</code>, <code>a"
       & "dacovex-vcs</code>, <code>adacovex-prove</code>, <code>adacovex-renderers-ma"
       & "n</code>, and <code>adacovex-parsers-manifest</code> are replaced by <code>A"
       & "dacovex. CPUs. Get_Temp_Directory</code>, which honours <code>TMPDIR</code> "
       & "/ <code>TEMP</code> / <code>TMP</code> environment variables and falls back "
       & "to <code>/tmp</code>. The shell executable is similarly abstracted through `"
       & "Adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>CPUs. Get_Shell_Command`.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-gnat-v1610-toolchain-rollout""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-gnat-v1"
       & "610-toolchain-rollout"">C4: GNAT v16.1.0 toolchain rollout</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action default, CI workflow pins, and documentation now all"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "target <code>gnat_native=16.1.0</code> (previous default was <code>15.2.1</c"
       & "ode>).  The action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "input default, <code>ci.yml</code>, <code>pr-check.yml</code>, <code>release"
       & ".yml</code>, <code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>docs/architecture.md</code> are updated so consumers do not inherit a "
       & "stale"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "toolchain pin.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-documentation-tier-separation-clarified""><a class=""header"" href="""
       & "#c5-documentation-tier-separation-clarified"">C5: Documentation tier separati"
       & "on clarified</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>AGENTS.md</code> now explicitly defines the two documentation tiers"
       & ": <code>docs/</code> (user"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "documentation: install, CLI, dashboard, SBOM, VCS, standards, CI/CD, proving"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "architecture, changelogs, HLR/LLR, performance) for end users and safety"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "engineers; and <code>docs/api-docs/</code> (generated gnatdoc reference, doc"
       & "string spec,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "test format, SPARK/DAL/ASIL/class levels) for contributors and auditors.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-hlr-index-completeness""><a class=""header"" href=""#c6-hlr-index-com"
       & "pleteness"">C6: HLR index completeness</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>HLR-COMPLEXITY</code> is added to both <code>docs/HLR.md</code> and"
       & " <code>docs/compliance/HLR.md</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "closing the gap between the tag used in source docstrings and the published"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "HLR index.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-complexity-check-target-no-longer-drifts-from-native-implementati"
       & "on""><a class=""header"" href=""#h1-complexity-check-target-no-longer-drifts-fro"
       & "m-native-implementation"">H1: Complexity-check target no longer drifts from n"
       & "ative implementation</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Makefile target description and help text now correctly state that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make complexity-check</code> invokes the native Ada checker (<code>./b"
       & "in/adacovex complexity</code>), removing the stale <code>tools/check-complex"
       & "ity.py</code> reference.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h2-stale-python-checker-references-purged-from-docs""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#h2-stale-python-checker-references-purged-from-docs"">H2: Stale Pyt"
       & "hon-checker references purged from docs</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>, <code>AGENTS.md</code>, <code>.github/workflo"
       & "ws/ci.yml</code>, and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>docs/changelogs/adacovex-1.24.0.md</code> no longer mention the remove"
       & "d"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>tools/check-complexity.py</code>; the complexity gate is now uniformly"
       & " described"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "as the native Ada implementation.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>900 tests passing across 14 categories.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved under gnatprove 16.1.0.  0 unproved, 0 justi"
       & "fied.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs.  Coverage:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-COMPLEXITY</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 docstrings and SPARK exception documentation for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the complexity checker; C6 added to HLR indexes;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-DOC</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 package-level and body docstrings for the complexity"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "module; C5 documentation tier separation;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-CI</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C2 Alire provisioning in the complexity-gate workflow; C4"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "GNAT v16.1.0 rollout in CI and action;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-CPU</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C3 portable temp-directory and shell abstractions.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See <code>docs/cli-reference.md</code>, <code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>, <code"
       & ">docs/architecture.md</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
