       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1250""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1250"">adacovex 1.25.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-24</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.24.0 -&gt; 1.25.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-complexity-checker-warning-hygiene""><a class=""header"" href=""#c1-c"
       & "omplexity-checker-warning-hygiene"">C1: Complexity checker warning hygiene</a"
       & "></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>adacovex-complexity.adb</code> now returns <code>Result</code> expl"
       & "icitly from the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Analyze_File</code> exception handler, eliminating the GNAT missing-re"
       & "turn warning,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the spurious <code>pragma Unreferenced</code> on <code>Print_Report</cod"
       & "e> thresholds has been"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "removed so the gate parameters are no longer flagged as unreferenced.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-playwright-acknowledged-as-a-development-dependency""><a class=""he"
       & "ader"" href=""#c2-playwright-acknowledged-as-a-development-dependency"">C2: Pla"
       & "ywright acknowledged as a development dependency</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md</code> and the dashboard Credits tab no"
       & "w list"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Playwright (Apache-2.0) as a development dependency used for end-to-end"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard layout tests (<code>make e2e</code>).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-dependency-tree-filter-state-preservation""><a class=""header"" href"
       & "=""#c3-dependency-tree-filter-state-preservation"">C3: Dependency tree filter "
       & "state preservation</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>filterByScope</code> JavaScript function now uses <code>Map</co"
       & "de> instead of a plain"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "object to snapshot and restore <code>details</code> open states, fixing the "
       & "bug where"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "DOM-element keys were stringified to <code>[object HTMLLIElement]</code> and"
       & " caused the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree to collapse irrecoverably after filtering.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-spark-proof-radar-on-overview-matches-robustness-styling""><a clas"
       & "s=""header"" href=""#c4-spark-proof-radar-on-overview-matches-robustness-stylin"
       & "g"">C4: SPARK proof radar on Overview matches Robustness styling</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The per-check-type SPARK proof radar on the Overview tab now uses the sam"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "split layout, tier badge, and legend structure as the Robustness radar,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "making both charts visually consistent.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-overview-chart-types-updated""><a class=""header"" href=""#c5-overvie"
       & "w-chart-types-updated"">C5: Overview chart types updated</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Test categories on the Overview tab now render as a Charts.css column cha"
       & "rt"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of a custom CSS grid, and docstring coverage uses a radial chart"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "styled consistently with the other quality gauges.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-charts-page-theme-awareness""><a class=""header"" href=""#c6-charts-p"
       & "age-theme-awareness"">C6: Charts page theme awareness</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>All chart colours on the Charts tab now use CSS custom properties (<code>"
       & "var(--accent)</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>var(--fg)</code>, <code>var(--border)</code>, <code>var(--card)</code>"
       & ", <code>var(--muted)</code>) so they"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "adapt automatically to light, dark, and system themes.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-nomnoml-diagram-inherits-dashboard-theme-colours""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#h1-nomnoml-diagram-inherits-dashboard-theme-colours"">H1: nomnoml d"
       & "iagram inherits dashboard theme colours</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The nomnoml renderer now reads <code>--card</code> and <code>--fg</code> "
       & "from the dashboard theme"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "variables, so the dependency diagram background and arrow colours match the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "active light/dark/system theme.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h2-standardsall-badge-set-includes-all-three-standard-families""><a c"
       & "lass=""header"" href=""#h2-standardsall-badge-set-includes-all-three-standard-f"
       & "amilies"">H2: Standards=all badge set includes all three standard families</a"
       & "></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>When <code>--standard=all</code> is selected the overview now emits badge"
       & "s for DO-178C,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "ISO 26262, and IEC 62304 at their target tiers (DAL-C, ASIL B, Class A),"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rather than only the single active standard.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>900 tests passing across 14 categories.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 720/720 VCs proved under gnatprove 16.1.0.  0 unproved, 0 justi"
       & "fied.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs.  Coverage:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-COMPLEXITY</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C1 warning hygiene in the complexity checker;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-DASH</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " C2 Playwright credit, C3 filter state preservation,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "C4/H1 nomnoml theme awareness, C5 chart-type alignment, C6 charts"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "theme awareness;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>HLR-STD</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " H2 standards=all badge completeness.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>See <code>docs/cli-reference.md</code>, <code>docs/ci-cd.md</code>, <code"
       & ">docs/architecture.md</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
