       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-130""><a class=""header"" href=""#adaco"
       & "vex-130"">adacovex 1.3.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-01</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.1.0 -&gt; 1.3.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-default-target-changed-to-the-current-working-directory""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#c1-default-target-changed-to-the-current-working-directory"""
       & ">C1: Default target changed to the current working directory</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Running <code>adacovex</code> without <code>--target</code> now audits th"
       & "e current working"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "directory instead of <code>../Ada_CRDT</code>. The default target is resolve"
       & "d to an"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "absolute path via <code>Ada.Directories.Current_Directory</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> <code>make run-self</code> no longer needs <code"
       & ">--target=.</code>; any directory can"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "be audited by simply running adacovex from it. <code>--target=PATH</code> st"
       & "ill works"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "for any other project.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2---help-now-exits-cleanly""><a class=""header"" href=""#c2---help-now-"
       & "exits-cleanly"">C2: <code>--help</code> now exits cleanly</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--help</code> prints the usage text and exits with status <code>0</"
       & "code> without scanning or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "assessment. Previously <code>--help</code> was parsed but adacovex continued"
       & " running the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "full pipeline and exited according to the DAL result. A dedicated"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Help_Requested</code> field was added to <code>CLI_Config</code> and h"
       & "andled in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex_main</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-generated-binder-files-removed-from-the-repo""><a class=""header"" h"
       & "ref=""#c3-generated-binder-files-removed-from-the-repo"">C3: Generated binder "
       & "files removed from the repo</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The generated <code>b__adacovex_main.*</code> and <code>b__test_runner.*<"
       & "/code> files were removed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "from version control (build artifacts only).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-differential-assessment---compare-baseref""><a class=""header"" href"
       & "=""#c4-differential-assessment---compare-baseref"">C4: Differential assessment"
       & " (<code>--compare-base=REF</code>)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code>--compare-base=REF</code> flag assesses a git base revision in "
       & "a temporary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "worktree (<code>/tmp/adacovex-diff-&lt;pid&gt;</code>) and prints a side-by-"
       & "side table against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the current working tree: packages, subprograms, docstring %, HLR traced,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "orphan tags, SPARK level, VCs proved, tests, DAL status. Exit code is <code>"
       & "0</code> only"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "when there is no regression and the current DAL is Achieved.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Implemented in the new non-SPARK <code>Adacovex.Diff</code> package (it s"
       & "pawns <code>git</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "via <code>GNAT.OS_Lib</code>), wired into <code>adacovex_main</code> as <cod"
       & "e>Run_Diff</code>, with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Compare_Base</code>/<code>Compare_Base_Len</code> added to <code>CLI_C"
       & "onfig</code>. Rows for proof/test"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifacts that the base revision does not commit report <code>N/A</code>.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-hardened-dev-manifest-swap-in-the-makefile""><a class=""header"" hre"
       & "f=""#c5-hardened-dev-manifest-swap-in-the-makefile"">C5: Hardened dev-manifest"
       & " swap in the Makefile</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>_dev_cmd</code> (used by <code>doc</code>, <code>fmt</code>; <code>"
       & "prove</code> no longer needs it now that"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>gnatprove</code> is a declared dependency of <code>alire.toml</code>) "
       & "snapshots <code>alire.toml</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alire.lock</code>, <code>alire.lock.prev</code>, and <code>alire/setti"
       & "ngs.toml</code> into a temp dir,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "swaps in <code>alire-dev.toml</code>, and restores the snapshots on exit via"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>trap ... EXIT INT TERM</code>. Interrupted or failed dev commands can "
       & "no longer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "leave the manifest or lock files polluted with development dependencies"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(whether or not the lock files are committed). <code>dev-setup</code> and <c"
       & "ode>prod-setup</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "were replaced with guidance stubs. <code>alire.toml</code> now declares <cod"
       & "e>gnatprove</code> as"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "an explicit dependency (adacovex analyses <code>gnatprove.out</code> and its"
       & " own"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "self-assessment runs the proof campaign), so <code>alr gnatprove</code> work"
       & "s without a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest swap; <code>gnatprove</code> is the only declared dependency be"
       & "yond the GNAT"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runtime (gnatdoc/gnatformat stay dev-only in <code>alire-dev.toml</code>).</"
       & "p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-github-actions-composite-action-ci-pr-gate-and-releases""><a class"
       & "=""header"" href=""#c6-github-actions-composite-action-ci-pr-gate-and-releases"""
       & ">C6: GitHub Actions: composite action, CI, PR gate, and releases</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code>.github/actions/adacovex/action.yml</code> (install Alire + GNA"
       & "T toolchain,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cache, build, run the assessment, publish <code>dal-status</code>/<code>spar"
       & "k-level</code>/"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>test-count</code>/<code>coverage-pct</code> outputs, a Markdown step s"
       & "ummary, and SVG badge"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "artifacts), plus three workflows:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>.github/workflows/ci.yml</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " self-assessment job + build/test job on push"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to main and pull requests.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>.github/workflows/pr-check.yml</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " runs <code>--coverage-delta</code> against"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>pull_request.base.sha</code> so any PR that drops docstring coverage f"
       & "ails.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>.github/workflows/release.yml</code> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " on a <code>v*</code> tag, builds the release binary,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "validates the self-assessment, and creates a GitHub Release with the binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tarball (<code>adacovex</code> + <code>covex</code> alias) and an action"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tarball. The tag itself publishes the action for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>uses: &lt;owner&gt;/adacovex/.github/actions/adacovex@vX.Y.Z</code>.</"
       & "li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Alire toolchain is installed from the official"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>alr-*-bin-x86_64-linux.zip</code> release assets, and the GNAT toolcha"
       & "in default is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the index-available <code>15.2.1</code>. Dead, build-generated <code>config/"
       & "covex_config.*</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "files are no longer tracked (gitignored). The release workflow force-pushes"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "floating <code>vMAJOR</code> / <code>vMAJOR.MINOR</code> tags (e.g. <code>v1"
       & "</code> and <code>v1.3</code> from <code>v1.3.0</code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "plus a <code>latest</code> tag, so the composite action can be consumed as <"
       & "code>@latest</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>@v1</code>, or <code>@v1.3</code> for the latest matching release; the"
       & " action"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "binary-download step resolves <code>@latest</code> (and any floating ref) to"
       & " the matching"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release tag, and a <code>coverage-pct</code> output is also emitted from the"
       & " docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "percentage in normal mode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-coverage-gate---coverage-deltaref""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-co"
       & "verage-gate---coverage-deltaref"">C7: Coverage gate (<code>--coverage-delta=R"
       & "EF</code>)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code>--coverage-delta=REF</code> flag for PR-style CI checks: it com"
       & "putes docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage on a git base ref and the current tree (scan + patches + metrics"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "only, no GNATprove/tests/DAL), prints a compact table and a machine-parseabl"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>coverage_delta: base=.. current=.. regressed=..</code> line, and exits"
       & " <code>1</code> when"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage dropped. Works on base refs that do not commit build artifacts and "
       & "is mutually"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "exclusive with <code>--compare-base</code>. <code>make release</code> now ru"
       & "ns this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docstring-coverage gate comparing the last release tag against the current"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tree and aborts if coverage regressed "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the same PR compliance gate, applied"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "between releases.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-binary-named-adacovex-clean-dev-tree""><a class=""header"" href=""#c8"
       & "-binary-named-adacovex-clean-dev-tree"">C8: Binary named <code>adacovex</code"
       & ">, clean dev tree</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The compiled CLI is now named <code>adacovex</code> (via <code>for Execut"
       & "able (""adacovex_main.adb"") use ""adacovex""</code> in <code>adacovex.gpr</code"
       & ">), with a <code>covex</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "symlink alias. All scripts, docs, and workflows reference <code>bin/adacovex"
       & "</code> /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>covex</code>; <code>adacovex_main</code> remains only as the internal "
       & "Ada source unit name.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>adacovex.gpr</code> now sets <code>for Object_Dir use ""obj""</code>,"
       & " so <code>*.o</code>, <code>*.ali</code>, <code>*.cswi</code>, <code>*.bexch"
       & "</code> no longer accumulate in the repo root. Stray artifacts were removed "
       & "from the working tree. The composite action gained <code>branding</code> (sh"
       & "ield/green) and an <code>author</code> so it can be listed on the GitHub Act"
       & "ions marketplace; each `vX. Y.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Z<code>release publishes the matching action version.</code>make badges<c"
       & "ode>in</code>Ada_CRDT<code>now builds adacovex first if the binary is missin"
       & "g and passes an explicit</code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "target=.`.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c9-all-workflows-use-the-single-composite-action""><a class=""header"" "
       & "href=""#c9-all-workflows-use-the-single-composite-action"">C9: All workflows u"
       & "se the single composite action</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>ci.yml</code> (self-assessment and build+tests jobs), <code>pr-chec"
       & "k.yml</code> (coverage"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "gate), and <code>release.yml</code> now all delegate to <code>.github/action"
       & "s/adacovex</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instead of duplicating inline Alire/GNATprove steps. The action gained three"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "inputs to cover every workflow need: <code>run-tests</code> (build + native "
       & "test suite,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>assess: false</code>), <code>release-build</code> (pass <code>--releas"
       & "e</code> to <code>alr build</code>), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>assess</code> (skip the assessment/outputs/badges for build/test-only "
       & "jobs).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-gnatprove-initialization-row-clobbered-flow-dependencies-data""><a"
       & " class=""header"" href=""#h1-gnatprove-initialization-row-clobbered-flow-depend"
       & "encies-data"">H1: GNATprove <code>Initialization</code> row clobbered Flow De"
       & "pendencies data</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Modern <code>gnatprove.out</code> emits separate <code>Flow Dependencies<"
       & "/code> and <code>Initialization</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "summary rows. The parser wrote both into <code>Flow_Checks</code> / <code>Fl"
       & "ow_Proved</code>, so a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "non-empty Initialization row overwrote the real flow-analysis numbers.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Impact:</strong> For projects with non-empty init checks, the Bro"
       & "nze level check"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>Flow_Proved &gt;= Flow_Checks</code>) used init data instead of flow "
       & "data, and the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Flow Dependencies"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " rows in the HTML dashboard and Markdown report showed the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "wrong values.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Added <code>Init_Checks</code> / <code>Init_Proved<"
       & "/code> to <code>Proof_Summary</code>, parse the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Initialization row into them, and surface an Initialization row in the HTML"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dashboard and Markdown verification report.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h2-proved_vcs-computed-incorrectly-for-modern-gnatprove-layout""><a c"
       & "lass=""header"" href=""#h2-proved_vcs-computed-incorrectly-for-modern-gnatprove"
       & "-layout"">H2: <code>Proved_VCs</code> computed incorrectly for modern GNATpro"
       & "ve layout</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The modern summary layout is <code>Total | Flow | Provers | Justified | U"
       & "nproved</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(no explicit "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Proved"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " column). The old code read column 3 as <code>Proved_VCs</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "which is the "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "solved-by-provers"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " count in the modern layout.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Fix:</strong> <code>Proved_VCs</code> is now computed as <code>To"
