       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-1320""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
       & "ovex-1320"">adacovex 1.32.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-28</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.31.0 -&gt; 1.32.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-proof-metrics-synced-to-the-honest-723-vc-count""><a class=""header"
       & """ href=""#c1-proof-metrics-synced-to-the-honest-723-vc-count"">C1: Proof metri"
       & "cs synced to the honest 723-VC count</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The self-assessment proof surface had grown to 723 VCs after the <code>Ad"
       & "acovex. Server. HTTP. Route</code> postcondition was converted from a nine-c"
       & "lause implication chain (which exceeded gnatprove"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s <code>--steps</code> budget once the <code>/docs</code> route was added) i"
       & "nto an expression function.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>An expression function"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s implicit postcondition (<code>Result = &lt;mapping&gt;</code>) holds by de"
       & "finition, so the mapping is proved without case-analysis steps. All metric a"
       & "nchors across AGENTS.md, README.md, Makefile, the release manifests, and the"
       & " Alire index were refreshed to 723 VCs via <code>make proof-status</code>. P"
       & "roof level remains</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><strong>Platinum</strong> (723 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified under gnatpro"
       & "ve 16.1.0).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-svg-badges-restored-to-shieldsio-proportions""><a class=""header"" h"
       & "ref=""#c2-svg-badges-restored-to-shieldsio-proportions"">C2: SVG badges restor"
       & "ed to Shields.io proportions</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The badge renderer had drifted away from the Shields.io style: font-size "
       & "was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "16px on a 28px-tall badge with 20px side padding, so the label and value tex"
       & "t"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dominated the box. Geometry is now restored to the compact Shields.io"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proportions "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " font-size 11px, badge height 20px, corner radius 3px, text"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "baseline y=14, and 10px side padding (20px total). The pure sizing math"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>Glyph_Width</code>, <code>Text_Width</code>) still bounds every segme"
       & "nt at font-size 11, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "badges stay provable and visually consistent with Shields.io.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-nomnoml-dependency-diagram-reads-left-to-right""><a class=""header"""
       & " href=""#c3-nomnoml-dependency-diagram-reads-left-to-right"">C3: nomnoml depen"
       & "dency diagram reads left-to-right</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The dependency hierarchy diagram rendered root-at-top with children flowi"
       & "ng"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "left-to-right (<code>#direction: down</code>). It now renders the root on th"
       & "e left and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the children stacked top-to-bottom on the right (<code>#direction: right</co"
       & "de>), which"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reads as a left-to-right dependency flow. The canvas height now scales with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the child-node count (72px header + 46px per node, 320px minimum) instead of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "a fixed 600px, so every box stays large enough to read and click regardless "
       & "of"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph size.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-charts-tab-label-and-data-overlap-removed""><a class=""header"" href"
       & "=""#c4-charts-tab-label-and-data-overlap-removed"">C4: Charts tab label and da"
       & "ta overlap removed</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Proof Check Types"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " column chart rotated its category labels vertically"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "into a 96px-tall slot, so long labels ("
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Termination"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ", "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Functional"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & ") clipped"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and overlapped their neighbours. The label slot is now 120px (chart height"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "340px) with clipping disabled, giving every rotated label the room it needs."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "The bar chart"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s per-row data labels (<code>.data</code>) now carry a translucent card"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "background and a small horizontal pad, so values on short bars no longer"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "collide with neighbouring rows. Verified against the dashboard e2e layout"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tests.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-overview-tab-adds-a-dependency-scope-polar-chart""><a class=""heade"
       & "r"" href=""#c5-overview-tab-adds-a-dependency-scope-polar-chart"">C5: Overview "
       & "tab adds a dependency-scope polar chart</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Overview tab"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s collation charts gained a "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Dependency Scope"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " polar area"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "chart. It renders the resolved graph"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s scope split (base / dev / transitive /"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "vendored / system) as a conic-gradient ring with a centre total count and a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "per-scope legend, giving an at-a-glance view of the project"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "composition alongside the existing Robustness, SPARK Proof, Tests, and Doc"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Coverage charts. The overview chart-card count in the e2e layout suite was"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "raised from four to five to match.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>973 tests (unchanged). No test logic changed: the proof fix is a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "postcondition-only rewrite, the badge and chart changes are presentational,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and the nomnoml direction/height change is client-side JavaScript. The"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>dashboard.spec.ts</code> overview assertion was updated to expect five"
       & " chart cards.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Platinum, 723/723 VCs proved across 50 analysed units (was 724 at 1.31.0)"
       & ". The one-VC reduction comes from converting `Adacovex. Server. HTTP.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Route<code>to an expression function: the explicit nine-clause postcondit"
       & "ion (one VC that sat on the solver's step-limit boundary) is replaced by the"
       & " implicit</code>Result = <mapping><code>postcondition, which proves by defin"
       & "ition. Invocation:</code>adacovex prove<code> (</code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & "steps=10000`, gnatprove 16.1.0). 0 unproved, 0 justified.</mapping></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>No new HLRs. The server routing change is covered by the existing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>-- HLR-SERVER</code> tag in <code>src/server/adacovex-server-http.ads<"
       & "/code>; the badge,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "chart, and diagram changes are presentational and reuse the existing"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>HLR-RENDER-SVG</code> / <code>HLR-RENDER-HTML</code> tags.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
