       & "                    <main>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-140""><a class=""header"" href=""#adaco"
       & "vex-140"">adacovex 1.4.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-03</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.3.0 -&gt; 1.4.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-proof-aware-sbom-generation-adacovex-sbom""><a class=""header"" href"
       & "=""#c1-proof-aware-sbom-generation-adacovex-sbom"">C1: Proof-aware SBOM genera"
       & "tion (<code>adacovex sbom</code>)</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New <code>sbom</code> subcommand generates a software bill of materials f"
       & "or the target"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project from its Alire manifest, <code>alire.lock</code> solved-crate list, "
       & "and GNAT"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "project (.gpr) with clauses:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>adacovex sbom --format=cyclonedx-json --out=path/to/sbom.json"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>--format</code> selects <code>cyclonedx-json</code> (default, writ"
       & "es <code>&lt;target&gt;/sbom.json</code>)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "or <code>spdx-json</code> (writes <code>&lt;target&gt;/sbom.spdx.json</code>"
       & ").</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>--out</code> overrides the output path; the containing directory i"
       & "s created"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "automatically.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The dependency graph is resolved by the new <code>Adacovex.Parsers.Manif"
       & "est</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "package: the root project is index 1, then alire.lock crates and GPR"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>with</code>-clause dependencies (including transitives) are appended, "
       & "with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cross-source deduplication.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The new <code>Adacovex.Renderers.SBOM</code> package emits CycloneDX 1.5"
       & " JSON and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "SPDX 2.3 JSON documents. Every component carries the proof-aware properties"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex:proof_level</code> (<code>Gold</code> or <code>Platinum</code"
       & "> from the assessed GNATprove"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "result) and <code>adacovex:dal_target</code> (<code>DAL-A</code> through <co"
       & "de>DAL-D</code>; empty for"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>DAL-E</code>), which in SPDX are encoded as <code>attributionTexts</co"
       & "de> entries.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>Both formats validate against the official CycloneDX 1.5 and SPDX 2.3 JS"
       & "ON"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "schemas.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>The SBOM mode scans sources, parses proof/tests, and assesses DAL first "
       & "so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the emitted properties reflect the real assessment state.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>Mutually exclusive with <code>--compare-base</code> and <code>--coverage"
       & "-delta</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-github-action-moved-to-the-repository-root""><a class=""header"" hre"
       & "f=""#c2-github-action-moved-to-the-repository-root"">C2: GitHub Action moved t"
       & "o the repository root</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action moved from <code>.github/actions/adacovex/action.yml"
       & "</code> to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>./action.yml</code>, so it is consumed directly as <code>uses: bladeac"
       & "er/adacovex@v1.4.0</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(no nested path) and is auto-discovered at the repo root for the marketplace"
       & "."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "All workflows (<code>ci.yml</code>, <code>pr-check.yml</code>, <code>release"
       & ".yml</code>) now reference"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>uses: ./</code>, and the release tarball packages the root <code>actio"
       & "n.yml</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3-action-sbom-inputs""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3-action-sbom-input"
       & "s"">C3: Action SBOM inputs</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The action gained two inputs:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>generate-sbom</code> (default <code>true</code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " after the assessment, generate a"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof-aware SBOM and upload it as an <code>adacovex-sbom</code> artifact, wi"
       & "th a row in"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Markdown step summary. Set <code>false</code> to skip.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>sbom-format</code> (default <code>cyclonedx-json</code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " SBOM format, passed to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>adacovex sbom --format=...</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>SBOM generation is skipped automatically in differential and coverage-gat"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "modes (the two modes are mutually exclusive with <code>sbom</code>), and a f"
       & "ailed SBOM"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(no Alire manifest, for example) is reported as a warning without failing th"
       & "e"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "job.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-sbom-proof-level-read-before-the-proof-parse""><a class=""header"" h"
       & "ref=""#h1-sbom-proof-level-read-before-the-proof-parse"">H1: SBOM proof level "
       & "read before the proof parse</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>Run_SBOM</code> computed the <code>adacovex:proof_level</code> prop"
       & "erty from the proof summary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before calling <code>Parse_Prove_From_Project</code>, so the emitted level w"
       & "as always"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Gold</code> (the default empty-summary mapping). The property is now c"
       & "omputed after"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the parse, so a verified target emits <code>Platinum</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Test suite extended with a new <code>Adacovex_SBOM_Tests</code> category "
       & "(53 checks)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "covering the proof/DAL property mapping, the Alire manifest + GPR dependency"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "graph fixture, and CycloneDX/SPDX rendering with quote-escaping and JSON"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "structural balance. The suite is now <strong>222 tests</strong>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
