       & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-180""><a class=""header"" href=""#adaco"
       & "vex-180"">adacovex 1.8.0</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Date: <em>2026-08-13</em></p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Version bumped 1.7.0 -&gt; 1.8.0.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""changes""><a class=""header"" href=""#changes"">Changes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c1-on-disk-result-caching""><a class=""header"" href=""#c1-on-disk-resul"
       & "t-caching"">C1: On-disk result caching</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Analysis results are cached on disk under <code>~/.adacovex/cache/&lt;ver"
       & "sion&gt;/</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "keyed by the SHA-256 of each input artifact. Unchanged source files serve"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "their parsed <code>Package_Info</code> from the cache instead of being re-sc"
       & "anned;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "unchanged <code>gnatprove.out</code> and test-result files likewise serve th"
       & "eir parsed"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "summaries. Cache effectiveness (<code>X hit(s), Y miss(es), Z evicted</code>"
       & ") is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "reported in the ANSI report. Controlled by <code>--cache</code> (default on)"
       & ","
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--no-cache</code>, <code>--cache-dir=PATH</code>, and <code>--cache-ma"
       & "x=N</code> (default 4096);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--no-cache</code> forces every run to re-scan / re-parse / re-prove, w"
       & "hich is"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "useful when artifacts change but keep the same content hash.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c2-cache-schema-namespace-and-overflow-safe-serialization""><a class="
       & """header"" href=""#c2-cache-schema-namespace-and-overflow-safe-serialization"">C"
       & "2: Cache-schema namespace and overflow-safe serialization</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The default cache root is <code>~/.adacovex/cache/&lt;version&gt;/&lt;Cac"
       & "he_Schema&gt;</code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "bumping <code>Cache_Schema</code> (in <code>src/core/adacovex-cache.ads</cod"
       & "e>) invalidates blobs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "written by incompatible builds instead of serving them as if valid."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Serialize</code> returns an empty blob when a payload would exceed <co"
       & "de>Max_Cache_Blob</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(callers refuse to store it) and <code>Deserialize</code> rejects empty/over"
       & "sized input,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "so truncated data can never be served as a cache hit.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c3---target-path-normalization""><a class=""header"" href=""#c3---target"
       & "-path-normalization"">C3: <code>--target</code> path normalization</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>--target</code> is normalised to a canonical absolute path (<code>."
       & "</code>/<code>..</code> collapsed)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before scanning, so the <code>File_Path</code> values stored in cached <code"
       & ">Package_Info</code> no"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "longer depend on how the target was spelled (e.g. <code>--target=../Ada_CRDT"
       & "</code> vs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>--target=.</code>). Docstring patches are matched by the package path "
       & "relative to"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the target root, so a cached path spelled through a different relative form"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "silently left those patches unapplied; normalization makes the cache"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "consistent across invocations.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c4-alire-manifest-compatibility""><a class=""header"" href=""#c4-alire-m"
       & "anifest-compatibility"">C4: Alire manifest compatibility</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>auto-gpr-with</code> is expressed in its boolean form (<code>true</"
       & "code>); the string form"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>auto-gpr-with = ""adacovex.gpr""</code> is rejected by the released <cod"
       & "e>alr</code> 2.1.1"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>Cannot read valid property</code>), which blocked <code>alr build</co"
       & "de> and therefore"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make build</code> / <code>make test</code> / <code>make run-self</code"
       & ">.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c5-hlr-completeness""><a class=""header"" href=""#c5-hlr-completeness"">C"
       & "5: HLR completeness</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>HLR-CACHE</code> (Result caching) and <code>HLR-CPU</code> (Cross-p"
       & "latform CPU core detection)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "are now defined in <code>docs/compliance/HLR.md</code>, removing the orphan "
       & "source tags"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and restoring <strong>DAL-C Achieved</strong> in strict mode.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c6-ada_crdt-make-targets""><a class=""header"" href=""#c6-ada_crdt-make-"
       & "targets"">C6: Ada_CRDT make targets</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <code>covex</code>/<code>prove</code>/<code>badges</code>/<code>sbom<"
       & "/code>/<code>coverage-gate</code> targets resolve the sibling"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>../adacovex</code> binary when present and fall back to <code>alr exec"
       & " -- adacovex</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "otherwise, so <code>make prove</code> / <code>make badges</code> / <code>mak"
       & "e sbom</code> work both in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "workspace and on CI.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c7-ci-result-cache-persistence""><a class=""header"" href=""#c7-ci-resul"
       & "t-cache-persistence"">C7: CI result-cache persistence</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The composite action gains a <code>result-cache</code> input (default on)"
       & " that persists"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>~/.adacovex/cache</code> between workflow runs with <code>actions/cach"
       & "e</code>;"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "content-addressed entries make restoring a stale cache always safe, so"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "incremental branches get mostly cache hits.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""c8-toolchain-aware-proof-cache-and-standalone-gnatprove-deployment"">"
       & "<a class=""header"" href=""#c8-toolchain-aware-proof-cache-and-standalone-gnatp"
       & "rove-deployment"">C8: Toolchain-aware proof cache and standalone gnatprove de"
       & "ployment</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The GNATprove result-cache key now folds in the resolved prover identity "
       & "(the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifest-pinned version for alire-managed deployments, else the resolved"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "executable/toolchain path), so a proof produced by one gnatprove is never re"
       & "used"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "after an upgrade or a different on-PATH / cached / downloaded toolchain "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " stale"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "entries simply miss and are transparently re-proved, with no explicit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "invalidation. The <code>prove</code> subcommand also stops composing the tar"
       & "get"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s entire"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest dependency set: instead of <code>alr exec -- gnatprove</code> ("
       & "which could"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "pull covex / gnatdoc_bin / gnatformat_bin and, for dev-only gnatprove, swap"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "manifests for the run), it deploys only the self-contained gnatprove binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "crate into <code>~/.adacovex/toolchain</code> via <code>alr -n get gnatprove"
       & "=&lt;version&gt;</code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "runs the deployed binary directly. The manifest version set expression"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>^15.1.0</code>, <code>~15.1.0</code>, "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(166)
       & ") is reduced to the bare version alr accepts."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "CI proof runs now depend on a single crate download instead of the full"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dev-manifest dependency closure, and the dev-manifest swap machinery is gone"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""fixes""><a class=""header"" href=""#fixes"">Fixes</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""h1-cache-eviction""><a class=""header"" href=""#h1-cache-eviction"">H1: C"
       & "ache eviction</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The cache root is stored without a trailing separator, and the eviction"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "helpers (<code>Count_Files</code>, <code>Oldest_File</code>) guard on <code>"
       & "Ada.Directories.Kind</code> instead"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "of <code>Exists</code>, which returns False for a bare directory on some GNA"
       & "T versions."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Together these make <code>--cache-max</code> eviction actually enforce the e"
       & "ntry cap"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(previously all entries were retained).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""test-suite""><a class=""header"" href=""#test-suite"">Test Suite</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>336/336 native tests passing; counts unchanged (no test files modified in"
       & " this"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "release).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""proof-results""><a class=""header"" href=""#proof-results"">Proof Results"
       & "</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Self-assessment remains <strong>Platinum</strong> (all VCs proved, 0 unpr"
       & "oved, AoRTE-free). <code>make prove</code> re-ran gnatprove 15.1.0 against t"
       & "he current tree: <strong>503/503</strong> VCs proved across 38 analysed unit"
       & "s. The cache, CLI, main-flow, and prove-resolution changes live in non-SPARK"
       & " units (<code>Adacovex. Cache</code>, <code>Adacovex. CPUs</code>, `Adacovex"
       & ".</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Config<code>, </code>Adacovex. Prove<code>, </code>adacovex_main<code>), "
       & "so no SPARK proof metrics regress. Ada_CRDT re-proved clean too: 584/584 VCs"
       & " (44 justified) across 34 analysed units, Platinum. Proof runs now deploy gn"
       & "atprove standalone via </code>alr -n get gnatprove=15.1.0<code>into</code>~/"
       & ".adacovex/toolchain` and execute that binary directly; identical inputs hit "
       & "the newly toolchain-aware result cache (verified: 30 hit(s), 0 miss(es) on r"
       & "e-run).</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""traceability""><a class=""header"" href=""#traceability"">Traceability</a"
       & "></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>New HLRs: <code>-- HLR-CACHE</code> on <code>Adacovex. Cache</code> (Resu"
       & "lt caching) and <code>-- HLR-CPU</code> on <code>Adacovex. CPUs</code> (Cros"
       & "s-platform CPU core detection). Existing tags continue to cover the changed "
       & "packages: <code>-- HLR-SCAN</code> on `Adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Parsers. Source<code>(scanning + patch application),</code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " HLR-CLI<code>on</code>Adacovex. Config<code>(path normalization, prove opti"
       & "ons),</code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " HLR-PROVE<code>on</code>Adacovex. Prove<code>, and </code>"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " HLR-PROOF<code>on</code>Adacovex.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Parsers. GNATprove`.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & ""
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                    </main>"
