       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""how-they-are-produced""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-they-are-produce"
       & "d"">How they are produced</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The Markdown renderer writes these files when the assessment runs"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>--emit-markdown=PATH</code>).  They are generated per target.  The fu"
       & "ll file"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "formats are documented in <a href=""../target-projects.html"">Target projects<"
       & "/a> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""../cli-reference.html"">CLI reference</a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The rendered text uses British English and ASD-STE100 Simplified Technica"
       & "l"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "English.  Technical terms follow the <a href=""../ste100-technical-names.html"
       & """>STE100 Technical Names"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dictionary</a>.  Audit the generated prose"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "against the dictionary before you use a new word in these reports.</p>"
