       & ASCII.LF
       & "                        <h1 id=""contributor-guide-codebase-structure-and-set"
       & "up""><a class=""header"" href=""#contributor-guide-codebase-structure-and-setup"""
       & ">Contributor guide: codebase structure and setup</a></h1>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This page is a human-readable tour of the adacovex codebase for people wh"
       & "o want"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "to build, test, or modify it. It supplements"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""https://github.com/bladeacer/adacovex/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"">CO"
       & "NTRIBUTING.md</a> (process, changelog format, PR rules)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "This page is about <strong>how the code is organised and how to get a workin"
       & "g"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "development environment</strong>. <code>AGENTS.md</code> is the machine-faci"
       & "ng version of the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "same information.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""setting-up-the-repository""><a class=""header"" href=""#setting-up-the-r"
       & "epository"">Setting up the repository</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Prerequisites:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Alire</strong> &gt;= 2.0 (<code>alr</code>) "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " the Ada package manager. It downloads and manages"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the GNAT toolchain for you.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>GNAT</strong> Ada compiler "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " managed by Alire (<code>alr</code> pulls <code>gnat_native</code>).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Python 3</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " only for build/dev tooling (<code>tools/*.py</code>). The shipped binary"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "has no Python dependency.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>gnatprove</strong> "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " optional for <em>using</em> adacovex, required for <code>make prove</code>."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It is resolved at run time (manifest pin, <code>$PATH</code>, cached toolcha"
       & "in, or"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "download). It lives in the dev manifest, never the published one.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">git clone https://github.com/bladeacer/adac"
       & "ovex.git"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "cd adacovex"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make build        # compiles bin/adacovex + bin/test_runner (covex alias)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make test         # builds + runs the native test suite (1173 tests)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make run-self     # assess adacovex itself: 100% docs, Platinum, DAL-C"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make prove        # SPARK proof (Platinum gate) + regenerates docs/badges/"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make check        # the whole quality gate CI runs before a release"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make check</code> is the pre-commit gate. It runs cheap static chec"
       & "ks first (ASCII, SPARK_Mode-Off policy, changelog format, version source, do"
       & "c-links, markdown links). Then it runs build, tests, proof, docs, and SBOM. "
       & "Then it runs tree-wide count-sync checks.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Everything must pass. The sync checks fail loudly when a count in any doc"
       & "umentation file is stale.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""repository-tour""><a class=""header"" href=""#repository-tour"">Repositor"
       & "y tour</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>src/"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- adacovex_main.adb              -- CLI entry point: parse -&gt; pipeline "
       & "-&gt; render -&gt; exit"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- adacovex.ads                   -- Version constant"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- core/                          -- config parsing, types, cache, VCS, GNA"
       & "Tprove runner, diff"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- parsers/                       -- input parsing: Ada source, gnatprove.o"
       & "ut, tests, manifest, HLR/LLR"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- renderers/                     -- output: ANSI, HTML dashboard, Markdown"
       & ", SVG badges, SBOM, man page"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- compliance/                    -- DO-178C DAL assessment logic"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- server/                        -- HTTP/1.1 server (4-worker task pool) f"
       & "or --serve"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "|-- ir/                            -- bounded IR types + future-use synthesi"
       & "ser"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "`-- tests/                         -- the native test suite (test_runner ent"
       & "ry point)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "resources/dashboard.html           -- the served dashboard's page shell (pla"
       & "in HTML, bundled at build time)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tools/*.py                         -- pure-stdlib Python: doc sync, count sy"
       & "nc, generators, validators"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "docs/                              -- all documentation (this guide, CLI ref"
       & "erence, standards, and more)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <strong>execution pipeline</strong> (<code>adacovex_main.adb</code>) "
       & "is the spine of the tool:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code>parse CLI -&gt; scan .ads sources -&gt; apply docstring patches -"
       & "&gt; compute doc metrics"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "-&gt; parse gnatprove.out -&gt; parse test results -&gt; assess DAL -&gt; re"
       & "nder ANSI report"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "-&gt; emit SVG badges -&gt; emit Markdown reports -&gt; emit SBOM -&gt; serv"
       & "e dashboard (if --serve)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "-&gt; exit code (0 = Achieved)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>A handful of modes exit before the pipeline: <code>--help</code>, <code>-"
       & "-version</code>, <code>man</code>,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>status</code>, the differential modes (<code>--compare-base</code> / <"
       & "code>--coverage-delta</code>), and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>sbom</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""where-things-live""><a class=""header"" href=""#where-things-live"">Where"
       & " things live</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<table>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tr><th>You want to"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(166)
       & "</th><th>Look at</th></tr>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</thead>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<tbody>"
