       & "</div>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""api-docs-and-cross-links""><a class=""header"" href=""#api-docs-and-cros"
       & "s-links"">API docs and cross-links</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make doc</code> regenerates <code>docs/api-docs/</code> from the <c"
       & "ode>.ads</code> docstrings via gnatdoc + <code>tools/rst2md.py</code>. It pr"
       & "oduces one page per package plus <code>index.md</code>. The six hand-written"
       & " reference pages are never regenerated. They are the docstring spec, the tes"
       & "t formats, the SPARK levels, and the DAL, ASIL, and Class level pages.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Cross-links between the generated package pages and the reference pages l"
       & "ive in <code>tools/rst2md.py</code>. <code>GUIDE_PAGES</code> builds the ind"
       & "ex"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "Guides"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " section. <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> builds the per-package "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(156)
       & "See also"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(157)
       & " lines. They do <strong>not</strong> live in the <code>.ads</code> comments:"
       & " gnatdoc parses comment text as RST and drops markdown link URLs. To add a p"
       & "ackage cross-link, extend <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> in <code>tools/rst2md."
       & "py</code>. Then run <code>make doc</code> and <code>make link-check</code>.<"
       & "/p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h3 id=""offline-manual-and-read-the-docs""><a class=""header"" href=""#offline-m"
       & "anual-and-read-the-docs"">Offline manual and Read the Docs</a></h3>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>docs/</code> is an mdBook project (<code>docs/book.toml</code> with"
       & " <code>src = "".""</code> and a root <code>docs/SUMMARY.md</code>). Read the D"
       & "ocs builds the public site from it; the same book is bundled into the binary"
       & " as the offline manual. When you add, move, or rename a doc page, update <co"
       & "de>docs/SUMMARY.md</code> in the same change. Then run <code>make book</code"
       & "> (regenerates <code>src/adacovex-docs_template.ads</code>), <code>make link"
       & "-check</code>, and <code>make docs-check</code>. <code>make book-serve</code"
       & "> serves the manual locally with mdBook"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s live server.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""testing""><a class=""header"" href=""#testing"">Testing</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The test suite is native and zero-dependency. <code>src/tests/</code> hol"
       & "ds one file per category (scanner, config, types, renderers, SBOM, VCS, and "
       & "more). Each file exposes a <code>Run (R : in out Runner'Class)</code> proced"
       & "ure wired into <code>src/tests/test_runner.adb</code>. A test is a <code>R. "
       & "Check (Condition, ""Description"")</code> call.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The runner counts them, prints a per-category table, and writes <code>doc"
       & "s/test_result.md</code>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-ada"">-- src/tests/adacovex_scanner_tests.adb (pat"
       & "tern to follow)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Adacovex.Parsers.Source.Scan_Ads_File (Tmp_File, Pkg, Success);"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "R.Check (Success, ""Test 1: parse succeeded"");"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>After adding or removing tests:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">make test          # rebuild + run; rewrite"
       & "s docs/test_result.md"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "make test-count    # sync every anchored count across the repo (AGENTS.md,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "                   # README, Makefile, CI workflows, manifests, agents-tree."
       & "map)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</code></pre>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The count-sync is enforced by <code>make check</code>. A test change that"
       & " skips the sync fails the gate. Tests write to <code>/tmp</code> scratch dir"
       & "s and clean up after themselves. The default on-disk result cache (<code>~/."
       & "adacovex/cache</code>) is shared.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Tests that exercise caching use content-hashed keys. They never depend on"
       & " each other"
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(153)
       & "s state.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""documentation-and-dashboard-tooling""><a class=""header"" href=""#docume"
       & "ntation-and-dashboard-tooling"">Documentation and dashboard tooling</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The pure-stdlib Python gates keep the docs and the dashboard in step with"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the code.  They are the drop-in replacements for the npm tools (stylelint,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "and more) that a JavaScript toolchain would use; adacovex keeps its dev"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "tooling Python-only by convention:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>tools/csslint.py</code> (<code>make csslint-check</code>) enforces"
       & " the 4px spacing rule:"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "every <code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, and <code>gap</code> pixel "
       & "length is a multiple of 4px."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "It runs inside <code>make build</code> and <code>make check</code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>tools/check-docs.py</code> (<code>make docs-check</code>) fails wh"
       & "en any paragraph in the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "user docs, README, or human changelogs exceeds four sentences, and it"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations (<code>i.e.</code>, <code>e.g.</co"
       & "de>, <code>etc.</code>)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>tools/para-split.py</code> rewraps over-long paragraphs to comply.</li"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> bundles the dashboard resources into"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> and minifies the authored C"
       & "SS and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "JavaScript (comments stripped, whitespace collapsed) before inlining.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Edit the dashboard under <code>resources/</code>, never the generated tem"
       & "plate.  After"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "any docs or resource change, run <code>make docs-check</code> and <code>make"
       & " csslint-check</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "before committing.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""spark-proof-discipline""><a class=""header"" href=""#spark-proof-discipl"
       & "ine"">SPARK proof discipline</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p><code>make prove</code> runs gnatprove through the <code>prove</code> sub"
       & "command and enforces the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Platinum gate: <strong>0 unproved VCs and 0 justified VCs</strong>. The rule"
       & "s that keep the"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof tractable:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>Every user assertion and every runtime check must be proved.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>No <code>pragma Assume</code> / <code>pragma Annotate</code> justificati"
       & "ons.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>No <code>pragma SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> anywhere except <code>Types.Impl"
       & "ementation</code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Complexity</code> (the two non-formal-<code>Ada.Containers</code> pack"
       & "ages. Non-formal"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Ada.Containers</code> are illegal in SPARK_Mode-On code "
       & Character'Val(226)
       & Character'Val(128)
       & Character'Val(147)
       & " gnatprove rejects"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "them; the evidence is in <code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code>. <code>mak"
       & "e spark-off-check</code> enforces this.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>I/O- and container-heavy units are default-off bodies or carry per-subpr"
       & "ogram"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> aspects. They never carry an explicit Off p"
       & "ragma.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The proof result is anchored in <code>docs/proof/</code> (the per-version"
       & " VC ledger)."
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>make proof-status</code> syncs the VC count and SPARK level into the d"
       & "ocs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""common-workflows""><a class=""header"" href=""#common-workflows"">Common "
       & "workflows</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Assess another project</strong>: <code>adacovex --target=PATH --"
       & "dal=C</code> (see"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<a href=""target-projects.html"">Target projects</a>).</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Dogfood</strong>: <code>make run-self</code> (adacovex against i"
       & "tself) and <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> (against the sibling <code>../Ada_"
       & "CRDT</code> checkout, strict mode). Both"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "must stay green.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Coverage gate between releases</strong>: <code>make coverage-gat"
       & "e</code> compares docstring"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "coverage between the latest two release tags.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Prepare a release</strong>: <code>make bump-version VERSION=x.y."
       & "z</code>, write the changelog"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "(<code>docs/changelogs/adacovex-x.y.z.md</code>, canonical format enforced b"
       & "y <code>make changelog-check</code>), then <code>make release VERSION=x.y.z<"
       & "/code>.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li><strong>Keep docs current</strong>: every code change updates the releva"
       & "nt user docs,"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "the Ada docstrings that feed <code>docs/api-docs</code>, and the changelog, "
       & "then"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "re-runs the sync gates (<code>make docs-check</code>, <code>make action-pari"
