       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>This directory holds the record of every SPARK proof run for adacovex.</p"
       & ">"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""reading-the-ledger""><a class=""header"" href=""#reading-the-ledger"">Rea"
       & "ding the ledger</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The <a href=""16.1.0-ledger.html"">gnatprove 16.1.0 ledger</a> documents th"
       & "e current"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "verified surface:</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>the VC counts (currently 724 VCs, 0 unproved, 0 justified, Platinum);</l"
       & "i>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>the audit of the skipped units and the reason each stays SPARK_Mode Off;"
       & "</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>the empirical evidence that the non-formal <code>Ada.Containers</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "instantiations in <code>Adacovex.Types.Implementation</code> and"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Adacovex.Complexity</code> are the only irreducible SPARK_Mode (Off)"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "packages;</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<li>the <code>[assumed-global-null]</code> warnings that the SPARK_Mode On"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<code>Adacovex.CPUs.Get_Temp_Directory</code> carries.</li>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "</ul>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<h2 id=""how-to-verify-the-numbers""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-to-verify-th"
       & "e-numbers"">How to verify the numbers</a></h2>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Run <code>make prove</code> at any time.  It runs gnatprove through the <"
       & "code>prove</code>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "subcommand and enforces the Platinum gate: 0 unproved VCs and 0 justified"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "VCs.  <code>make proof-status</code> then syncs the measured counts into the"
       & " docs.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>The full proving workflow, including proof patches over vendored"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dependencies, lives in <a href=""../proving.html"">Proving and writing proofs<"
       & "/a>.</p>"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "<p>Documentation in this directory uses British English and ASD-STE100"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "Simplified Technical English.  See the <a href=""../ste100-technical-names.ht"
       & "ml"">STE100 Technical Names"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "dictionary</a> for the approved terms about"
       & ASCII.LF
       & "proof, verification condition, and SPARK.</p>"
